{"seq":1,"slug":"continual-problem","title":"持续学习问题与场景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/continual-lifelong-learning/foundations/continual-problem","wordCount":1801,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"持续学习问题与场景\">持续学习问题与场景</h1><p>想象一个图像分类模型今天上线识别猫狗，下个月业务要它再认鸟，半年后又要认昆虫。最省事的做法是把全部数据攒起来重训一遍，但当历史数据有 TB 级、用户隐私不允许长期留存、或者重训一次要烧掉几万美元时，这条路就走不通了。持续学习要解决的，正是「只拿当前这批数据、在已有模型上接着学、还不能忘掉以前会的」这个具体而尖锐的工程约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>持续学习把训练过程建模成一个任务序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1, T_2, \\dots, T_N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 依次到达的过程。在学习第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个任务时，模型原则上只能访问当前任务的数据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对历史数据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_1, \\dots, D_{k-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的访问被严格限制或完全禁止。模型用一组共享参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 拟合所有任务，目标是在学完整个序列后，对所有见过的任务都保持高性能：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta^* = \\arg\\min_\\theta \\sum_{k=1}^{N} \\mathbb{E}_{(x,y)\\sim D_k}\\,[\\mathcal{L}(f_\\theta(x), y)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>难点在于求和号里的每一项不能同时优化——你只能在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到达时优化第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 项，而此时前面各项的数据已经不可见了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[数据流] --&gt; B[任务 T1 到达&lt;br/&gt;仅 D1 可见]&#10;    B --&gt; C[在 θ 上训练 T1]&#10;    C --&gt; D[任务 T2 到达&lt;br/&gt;D1 不可访问]&#10;    D --&gt; E[在 θ 上训练 T2]&#10;    E --&gt; F{评估全部历史任务}&#10;    F --&gt;|稳定性差| G[灾难性遗忘&lt;br/&gt;T1 性能崩塌]&#10;    F --&gt;|理想| H[全任务高性能]\">flowchart TD\n    A[数据流] --&gt; B[任务 T1 到达&lt;br/&gt;仅 D1 可见]\n    B --&gt; C[在 θ 上训练 T1]\n    C --&gt; D[任务 T2 到达&lt;br/&gt;D1 不可访问]\n    D --&gt; E[在 θ 上训练 T2]\n    E --&gt; F{评估全部历史任务}\n    F --&gt;|稳定性差| G[灾难性遗忘&lt;br/&gt;T1 性能崩塌]\n    F --&gt;|理想| H[全任务高性能]</pre><p>下表对比持续学习与几种相邻范式的关键约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>数据可见性</th>\n<th>任务边界</th>\n<th>优化目标</th>\n<th>主要挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传统监督学习</td>\n<td>全部数据一次给齐</td>\n<td>单任务</td>\n<td>当前任务误差</td>\n<td>泛化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多任务学习</td>\n<td>全部任务联合可见</td>\n<td>已知且并行</td>\n<td>各任务联合误差</td>\n<td>任务平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迁移学习</td>\n<td>源→目标，两阶段</td>\n<td>两个</td>\n<td>目标任务误差</td>\n<td>负迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续学习</td>\n<td>仅当前任务片段可见</td>\n<td>序列到达</td>\n<td>全部历史任务误差</td>\n<td>灾难性遗忘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>持续学习与多任务学习的本质差别就在「可见性」一列：多任务学习把所有任务的数据混在一起训练，是持续学习的性能上界（常被称作 joint training 或 offline 上界）；持续学习要在看不到历史数据的限制下，尽可能逼近这个上界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"任务流的三种来源\">任务流的三种来源</h2><p>现实中的任务序列从何而来，决定了问题的形状。第一种是新类别不断出现：分类系统今天认 10 类，明天扩到 20 类，这是类增量的典型来源。第二种是新领域不断出现：同样做情感分析，先是电商评论，后是医疗文本，标签空间不变但数据分布漂移，这是域增量。第三种是全新任务不断出现：从分类到检测再到分割，连任务类型都在变。这三种来源对应的形式化设定有本质难度差异，详见 <a href=\"../settings/task-class-incremental\">任务与类增量</a> 的深入讨论。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是，任务边界在真实数据流里常常是模糊甚至不存在的。论文里习惯假设有清晰的任务切换信号（task boundary），但摄像头采集的视频流、用户行为日志这类数据是平滑漂移的，根本没有「现在切到任务 2 了」的提示。无边界设定把问题推向 <a href=\"../settings/online-streaming\">在线与流式学习</a> 所讨论的更严苛约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据漂移-问题的物理根源\">数据漂移：问题的物理根源</h2><p>持续学习之所以困难，根子在于训练数据的分布随时间变化，违背了机器学习赖以成立的独立同分布（i.i.d.）假设。把整个数据流看成一个随时间变化的联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_t(x, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，漂移可以拆成两类。协变量漂移指输入分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_t(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变了，比如摄像头从白天拍到黑夜；概念漂移指条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_t(y \\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变了，比如「垃圾邮件」的定义随对抗演化而改变。</p>\n<p>标准随机梯度下降隐含假设每个 mini-batch 都是从同一个固定分布采样的。当分布随时间漂移，后到的梯度持续把参数拉向新分布的最优区域，旧分布的最优区域被无情抛弃——这正是下一篇 <a href=\"catastrophic-forgetting\">灾难性遗忘机理</a> 要从微观层面剖析的现象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么不能简单地-都存下来重训\">为什么不能简单地「都存下来重训」</h2><p>最朴素的反驳是：把所有历史数据存下来，每次有新任务就全量重训，不就没有遗忘了吗？这在小规模下确实可行，也正是前面说的 joint training 上界。但它在四个维度上不可持续。存储维度，工业级数据流是无界的，TB 到 PB 级数据无法永久驻留。计算维度，每来一个任务就重训全量，成本随任务数线性甚至超线性增长。隐私维度，GDPR 等法规要求用户数据「被遗忘权」，长期留存原始数据本身就违规。时延维度，自动驾驶、推荐这类场景要求模型分钟级甚至秒级更新，全量重训的延迟完全不可接受。</p>\n<p>正是这四重约束，把「持续地、增量地、有限内存地学习」从一个可有可无的优化，变成了一个必须解决的硬需求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四重约束如何落到工程决策\">四重约束如何落到工程决策</h3><p>把四重约束逐一展开，能看清它们各自否决掉哪条路径、又逼出什么替代方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束维度</th>\n<th>具体后果</th>\n<th>被否决的路径</th>\n<th>逼出的替代方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>数据流无界，TB–PB 级</td>\n<td>永久留存全部历史</td>\n<td>有界缓冲区 / 参数化记忆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算</td>\n<td>成本随任务数增长</td>\n<td>每任务全量重训</td>\n<td>只在新数据上增量更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐私</td>\n<td>「被遗忘权」等法规</td>\n<td>长期保留原始样本</td>\n<td>生成式/特征回放、联邦学习</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时延</td>\n<td>分钟级甚至秒级更新</td>\n<td>离线批量重训</td>\n<td>在线单遍更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表也预告了后面章节的走向：存储与计算约束把方法推向正则化与参数隔离，隐私约束催生回放的变体与联邦设定，时延约束则与在线流式学习直接对应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>持续学习把训练建模成任务序列依次到达、历史数据受限访问的过程，目标是逼近多任务联合训练的性能上界。</li>\n<li>它区别于多任务、迁移学习的核心在于数据可见性约束：任意时刻只能看到当前任务片段。</li>\n<li>任务流有新类别、新领域、新任务三种来源，分别对应类增量、域增量、任务增量设定。</li>\n<li>困难的物理根源是数据分布随时间漂移（协变量漂移与概念漂移），违背了 SGD 依赖的 i.i.d. 假设。</li>\n<li>「全存下来重训」受存储、计算、隐私、时延四重约束而不可持续，这正是持续学习存在的理由。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：Wang 等《Continual Learning of Large Language Models: A Comprehensive Survey》(ACM Computing Surveys 2025, arXiv:2404.16789)；《Continual Learning in Large Language Models: Methods, Challenges, and Opportunities》(arXiv:2603.12658, 2026)。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"持续学习问题与场景","id":"持续学习问题与场景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"任务流的三种来源","id":"任务流的三种来源"},{"level":2,"text":"数据漂移：问题的物理根源","id":"数据漂移-问题的物理根源"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么不能简单地「都存下来重训」","id":"为什么不能简单地-都存下来重训"},{"level":3,"text":"四重约束如何落到工程决策","id":"四重约束如何落到工程决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"灾难性遗忘机理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/continual-lifelong-learning/foundations/catastrophic-forgetting"}}